{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫（TVB）皇牌節目《女神配對計劃2》即將播出，最近TVB在網上舉行一系列宣傳，有多位「女神」玩小遊戲大談揀偶條件，其中阮嘉敏和何沛珈玩字卡遊戲，簡直是笑料百出。</p><figure><img alt=\"阮嘉敏何沛珈互爆怪癖？（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1139950168481730560986510.png/6Qv6uFPZwBbR11CXQdq2t4wesYx_ptUzMYtj_DGLY_w\"/><figcaption>阮嘉敏何沛珈互爆怪癖？（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>女神大爆重口味揀偶條件：情趣內衣當小事 掹鼻毛係基本</p><p>阮嘉敏問何沛珈：「如果你有好完美男朋友，但係鼻毛生出嚟。」何沛珈回答：「8分！剪得㗎嘛，我幫佢剪囉，我幫佢掹添啦，或者幫佢塞返條鼻毛入去。」何沛珈又問阮嘉敏：「如果佢係一個滿分男朋友，但係每晚都要你着情趣內衣。」阮嘉敏：「10分囉，好小事啫。」何沛珈展現「J」卡牌，說：「即係表示你好鍾意着情趣內衣。」阮嘉敏拿過卡牌後手舞足蹈，十分之high。阮嘉敏問：「如果你有好完美男朋友，但係佢唔鍾意換底褲。」何沛珈回答：「零分，好過份，好污糟，我好注重衛生㗎，完全接受唔到。」</p><figure><img alt=\"何沛珈表示唔介意幫男朋友掹鼻毛。（ig截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1139950170960695296096154.png/N5O6pAk_oEbqBcmK4S9DVb5678jmnB8G3UzM_t1MzP4\"/><figcaption>何沛珈表示唔介意幫男朋友掹鼻毛。（ig截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阮嘉敏又話可以晚晚着情趣內衣氹男朋友開心。（ig截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260606/1139950173158641664981324.png/2OB9UFPowe8seY6BCCNo3oFk_0cq0D7TeXKRO3lykTs\"/><figcaption>阮嘉敏又話可以晚晚着情趣內衣氹男朋友開心。（ig截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阮嘉敏戴上皇冠仙氣十足。（IG：@mandyyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240511/865926284960862208543890.jpeg/jg891cD3mD3NCK7BhCJYQAoxi0ofxuZhzwMx-s8DMfo\"/><figcaption>阮嘉敏戴上皇冠仙氣十足。（IG：@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阮嘉敏身材甚有睇頭。（IG：@mandyyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240824/903929425119678464582170.jpeg/h1ftqwv6fM7WwQcii0h5PmVpeX0addNfBRyeTwUcnk8\"/><figcaption>阮嘉敏身材甚有睇頭。（IG：@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阮嘉敏身材甚有睇頭。（IG：@mandyyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240824/903929418186100736926530.jpeg/bUbGk9UGpUamJUl-dAOkfd9g19La43_sbT7num0-57o\"/><figcaption>阮嘉敏身材甚有睇頭。（IG：@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阮嘉敏啲姿勢好高難度。（ig@mandyyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251226/1081311886936510464419650.jpeg/LBjdNt6yxHXkiLdwxaWmoXHyTiKmoBFHCgKq0QoCqtE\"/><figcaption>阮嘉敏啲姿勢好高難度。（ig@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"阮嘉敏散發女人味。（ig@mandyyuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251226/1081312150473150464271536.jpeg/lQyTNODib2NyidLZPj6A8ZvxnsvXz94HDVLBWA1SwVg\"/><figcaption>阮嘉敏散發女人味。（ig@mandyyuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何沛珈熱愛運動。（IG：@hpgroxanne）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240701/884410558416162816687124.jpeg/lD2VO4azoEj-ROik3WR-j_ckTbn7hWA3nRuxUJ0bsVA\"/><figcaption>何沛珈熱愛運動。（IG：@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何沛珈上載噴血泳照。（IG：@hpgroxanne）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250816/1033426247423627264324967.jpeg/I74zcUyBfeGnvUFNhEp0x8B0BUbStgTh6jZ0leo2dJU\"/><figcaption>何沛珈上載噴血泳照。（IG：@hpgroxanne）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何沛珈好fit。(何沛珈ig)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260103/1084140490087469056106523.jpeg/_wVt935cuSUNOWDwa-sAKLxoa9XCOaxSnINAcJyDQHA\"/><figcaption>何沛珈好fit。(何沛珈ig)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「東張女神」何沛珈今日於電視城出席TVB戀綜《女神配對計劃2》全球招親記者會。（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260416/1121539916837163008645938.jpeg/lBrBJWWbgdu1qILRMOGo8O4VMrN2-wJHK3jm7hF45u4\"/><figcaption>「東張女神」何沛珈今日於電視城出席TVB戀綜《女神配對計劃2》全球招親記者會。（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T15:09:23.836537+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":658,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}